  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1300.html",
  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1310.04 Emission Standards for Wallboard Manufacturing Facilities Firing Oil",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1310.04 Emission Standards for Wallboard Manufacturing Facilities Firing Oil. For wallboard dryers, calcining mills, calciners, and gypsum rock dryers firing fuel oil, the NOx RACT requirements shall be as follows:\n\n(a) When firing No. 2 fuel oil:\n\n(1) An emission limit of 0.10 lb. per million Btu, based on an hourly average; or\n\n(2) Implement NOx RACT control technology as specified in Env-A 1310.02(b); and\n\n(b) When firing No. 4, No. 5, or No. 6 fuel oil:\n\n(1) An emission limit of 0.30 lb. per million Btu, based on a 24-hour calendar day average; or\n\n(2) Implement NOx RACT control technology as specified in Env-A 1310.02(b).\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1300) #9803, eff 10-31-10; ss by #12584, eff 8-15-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1300.html"
}
